        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:486.8320617675781,729.917724609375,1413.5361022949219,2386.517333984375",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p><i>Registration mark on left</i></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Let it be registered in the office of accounts,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">if God wills.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They have registered the amount of three, a half and a sixteenth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God for his bounties.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb for the sum owed\u00a0through his standing surety for the estates in the town of al-Fayy\u016bm\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[for the year] four-hundred and three, under the supervision of the auspicious,\u00a0rightly-guided judge, \u1e6eiqat al-Mulk</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[Mak\u012bn al-Dawla] wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh\u0101, the prot\u00e9g\u00e9 of the commander of the faithful, \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r,\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with \u02beAb\u016b al-Sar\u012b Theodor ibn Yu\u1e25annis [acting as accountant].\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[Half of this:] One, [a half and a quarter]. Its amount: Three, a half and a sixteenth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101\u02be\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd] al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The thirteenth of</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Jum\u0101d\u0101 II, in the year four-hundred and three.\u00a0</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
